---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import { SITE, url } from '../lib/site';

const FILES = [
  ['Logo, app icon (SVG)', '/press/vuoom-logo.svg'],
  ['Logo, app icon (PNG, 1024)', '/press/vuoom-logo-1024.png'],
  ['Mark only, for dark backgrounds (SVG)', '/press/vuoom-mark.svg'],
  ['Screenshot: home and recovery', '/press/vuoom-home.png'],
  ['Launch film (MP4, 2 min)', '/media/launch.mp4'],
  ['Auto-zoom dashboard clip (MP4)', '/media/demo.mp4'],
];
---
<Doc path="/press/" label="Press kit" title="Press kit." sub="Everything you need to write about Vuoom. Free to use for that.">
  <h2>In one line</h2>
  <p>Vuoom is a free, open-source screen recorder for Windows and macOS whose camera zooms smoothly into what you click.</p>

  <h2>In 50 words</h2>
  <p>Vuoom is a free, open-source screen recorder for Windows 10/11 and macOS 14+. As you record, the camera zooms into each click with critically-damped spring motion so interface text stays readable. Trim, cut, add offline captions, then export a small GIF or MP4. No account, no watermark, no cloud. Apache-2.0.</p>

  <h2>In 100 words</h2>
  <p>Vuoom is a free, open-source screen recorder for Windows and Apple Silicon Macs that makes software demos readable. A flat full-screen capture shrinks every button to a few pixels; Vuoom's camera glides into each click on a critically-damped spring, with a redrawn smooth pointer and subtle motion blur. It records separate microphone and system audio tracks, a reshapeable webcam bubble, removes fan noise with RNNoise, generates captions offline with whisper.cpp, and exports compact GIFs or GPU-encoded 60 fps MP4s with a live size estimate. Built in Rust with Tauri and wgpu, licensed Apache-2.0.</p>

  <h2>Files</h2>
  <ul>{FILES.map(([n, f]) => <li><a href={url(f)} download>{n}</a></li>)}</ul>

  <h2>Colours and type</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Darkroom Ground</td><td><code>#110F0E</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Daylight Studio</td><td><code>#F4F0E8</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Alabaster Ink</td><td><code>#F6EFE5</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Record Crimson</td><td><code>#E5484D</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Tungsten Accent</td><td><code>#E4A45F</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Type</td><td>Bricolage Grotesque, Geist, Geist Mono</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Facts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Name: Vuoom (one word, capital V)</li>
    <li>Platforms: Windows 10/11 and macOS 14+ Apple Silicon</li>
    <li>Price: free</li>
    <li>Licence: Apache-2.0</li>
    <li>Built with: Rust, Tauri, wgpu, SolidJS</li>
    <li>Website: <a href={url('/')}>razee4315.github.io/Vuoom</a></li>
    <li>Source: <a href={SITE.repoUrl} rel="noopener">github.com/Razee4315/Vuoom</a></li>
    <li>Maker: <a href={SITE.authorUrl} rel="noopener">Saqlain Razee</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Please</h2>
  <p>Do not change the logo's colours or proportions, and do not use it to suggest something is made by Vuoom when it is not.</p>
</Doc>
